# Where the built-in SGM soundfont is fetched from.
#
# The .sf2 is 229 MB, so it can't live in git (GitHub blocks >100 MB) and can't be
# served by Cloudflare Pages/Workers assets (25 MiB per-file cap). Host it yourself —
# Cloudflare R2 with a public bucket is the intended setup — and point this at it.
#
# With this unset, the app falls back to /soundfonts/SGM-V2_01-XG-2_06.sf2, which the
# SPA answers with index.html when the file isn't there; the picker now reports that
# as "isn't hosted yet" instead of failing to parse.
#
# For local dev you can instead drop the .sf2 into public/soundfonts/ (gitignored).
VITE_SF_SGM_URL=https://your-bucket.r2.dev/SGM-V2_01-XG-2_06.sf2
